      "updated": 1792000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reading privacy: no identity or target in NodeView evidence; no join to the authenticated parent command.\nBest-effort diagnostic/file failure does not undo business work. Required SQL audit failure prevents the business commit.\nGauges are available for a .NET collector to poll; local queue metric JSONL is explicitly written by QueueState.\nArrows describe control/data flow, not exact wall-clock scheduling between independent tasks.",
      "originalText": "Reading privacy: no identity or target in NodeView evidence; no join to the authenticated parent command.\nBest-effort diagnostic/file failure does not undo business work. Required SQL audit failure prevents the business commit.\nGauges are available for a .NET collector to poll; local queue metric JSONL is explicitly written by QueueState.\nArrows describe control/data flow, not exact wall-clock scheduling between independent tasks.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
